                                <p><p  'Times New Roman'; line-height: normal; font-size: medium; ""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  large; "">(Haye Akber) x4</span><br></p><span class=""Apple-style-span""  'Times New Roman'; line-height: normal; font-size: medium; ""><font size=""4""><p>(Tanha abtak ashk bahaye, akber ki bimar behen) x2</p><p>Diwaaro se sar takraye, akber ki bimar behen</p><p>(Tanha abtak ashk bahaye, akber ki bimar behen) x2</p><ol><li>(Khun rawa hai ankho se aur, lab par nawha bhayi kaa) x2</li><p>tabse gham ki deep jalaye, akber ki bimar behen</p><p>(Tanha abtak ashk bahaye, akber ki bimar behen) x2</p><p>Diwaaro se sar takraye, akber ki bimar behen</p><p>(Tanha abtak ashk bahaye, akber ki bimar behen) x2</p><li>(darwaze par aas lagaye, rasta takti rehti hai) x2</li><p>ashko se khat likhti jaye, akber ki bimar behen</p><p>(Tanha abtak ashk bahaye, akber ki bimar behen) x2</p><p>Diwaaro se sar takraye, akber ki bimar behen</p><p>(Tanha abtak ashk bahaye, akber ki bimar behen) x2</p><li>(aaja akber aaja akber, toot rahi hai saas meri) x2</li><p>zakhme jigar kisko dikhlaye, akber ki bimar behen</p><p>(Tanha abtak ashk bahaye, akber ki bimar behen) x2</p><p>Diwaaro se sar takraye, akber ki bimar behen</p><p>(Tanha abtak ashk bahaye, akber ki bimar behen) x2</p><li>(kay shabaan ramazan bhi guzre, eid ka din bhi gazar gaya) x2</li></ol><p>kisko apna haal bataye, akber ki bimar behen</p><p>(Tanha abtak ashk bahaye, akber ki bimar behen) x2</p><p>Diwaaro se sar takraye, akber ki bimar behen</p><p>(Tanha abtak ashk bahaye, akber ki bimar behen) x2</p></font></span></p>
                 